DocumentComment: License inventory for the orca-slicer 2.4.2-r0 Alpine aport. Application declared license: AGPL-3.0-only. This inventory does not establish binary distribution compliance. Vendored sources were license-checked in the v2.4.2 tarball; superbuild downloads are pinned by URL plus SHA256 with licenses per each upstream project's stated license. The non-free Bambu networking plugin is excluded and intentionally has no entry here. Human-readable companion: SBOM.md.

